# Harness Runtime（Harness 运行时）- ADR-0002 D4 Consumer-Side Minimal Redistribution Policy
# ai-codeops-harness installer-managed artifacts are NOT redistributed by this
# repository. Consumers who need them should run the ai-codeops-harness installer.
# Project-generated Runtime Facts under .ai/state/** stay tracked.
/AGENTS.md
/.ai/VERSION
/.ai/rules/
/.ai/roles/
/.ai/workflows/
!/.ai/state/

# Session screenshots（会话截图）- excluded from the public baseline.
# Kept on disk as local Contract Drift Evidence. They are personal Claude Code
# session captures, are referenced by no document, and cannot be scanned by the
# text-based Release Safety Gate. Publishing them needs an explicit human decision.
/imgs/
